<title>USA: American Greetings full-year EPS on track.</title>
<headline>American Greetings full-year EPS on track.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Greetings Corp said Monday that it remains on track to report earnings of between $2.20 to $2.25 per share for this fiscal year.</p>
<p>The estimate represents a 10 percent increase from last year's $2.01 per share before an impairment charge, the cmpany said.</p>
<p>Last month the company reported third quarter earnings of $1 per share.</p>
</text>
